#: model:product.template,name:guest_house.product_template_12
msgid "Breakfast (1 guest)"
msgstr "Sarapan (1 tamu)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_14
msgid ""
"Bright, airy and full of natural light, from sun-drenched mornings to "
"soothing evenings."
msgstr ""

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products,\n"
"            sale orders and more."
msgstr ""
"Dengan mengunggah data demo modul ini, database Anda telah diisi dengan "
"beberapa produk,\n"
"            sales order, dan lainnya."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "Tagih pelanggan Anda sesuai jumlah akhir dan semuanya beres!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "Membuat tagihan untuk tamu"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guests who stayed in each room. "
"Then confirm the number of city taxes to be charged, which updates the "
"delivered city tax count."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dan sesuaikan (bila perlu) jumlah tamu yang menginap di setiap "
"kamar. Setelah itu, konfirmasi jumlah pajak kota yang akan dikenakan. "
"Nantinya, jumlah pajak kota yang telah disampaikan akan diperbarui."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "Melakukan check-in tamu"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "Melakukan check-out tamu"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check information and then confirm the booking."
msgstr "Periksa informasi, lalu konfirmasi pemesanan."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "Periksa data faktur, lalu konfirmasi."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Check-in is from 3:00 PM and check-out is until 11:00 AM. Early or late "
"arrangements can often be made on request."
msgstr ""

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"Pajak Kota harus ditagih berdasarkan jumlah malam aktual yang dihabiskan, "
"bukan secara teoritis, dan dihitung sebagai jumlah total malam yang "
"dihabiskan oleh setiap tamu."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the room to book."
msgstr "Klik salah satu kamar untuk dipesan."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr ""
"Klik tombol Check in untuk mengonfirmasi bahwa tamu kini menginap di tempat "
"Anda!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr "Klik tombol Check out untuk merekam pengembalian kunci."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "Klik Buat Pesanan untuk membuka formulir pesanan."

#. module: guest_house
